{"id":"3374832c41169108","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-disjoint-union-weak-normalization.md","title":"弱正规化的模块性","display":"thm-disjoint-union-weak-normalization — 弱正规化的模块性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-disjoint-union-weak-normalization","aliases":["56-thm-disjoint-union-weak-normalization"],"display":"thm-disjoint-union-weak-normalization — 弱正规化的模块性","depends_on":["[[56-df-disjoint-union]]","[[56-df-weakly-normalizing]]","[[56-df-modular-term-rank]]"],"source_section":"§5.7.2 Proposition 5.7.9","source_printed_pages":"167","source_ocr_blocks":[188],"source_verification":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-disjoint-union-weak-normalization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-disjoint-union-weak-normalization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-disjoint-union-weak-normalization — 弱正规化的模块性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"73130ab4ebcdfb39\" href=\"?note=73130ab4ebcdfb39\" title=\"56-df-disjoint-union\">56-df-disjoint-union</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"049c0e933557b214\" href=\"?note=049c0e933557b214\" title=\"56-df-weakly-normalizing\">56-df-weakly-normalizing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"01802560a40eec95\" href=\"?note=01802560a40eec95\" title=\"56-df-modular-term-rank\">56-df-modular-term-rank</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§5.7.2 Proposition 5.7.9"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"167"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>188</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"73130ab4ebcdfb39\" href=\"?note=73130ab4ebcdfb39\" title=\"56-df-disjoint-union\">56-df-disjoint-union</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_i,R_i,V,T_i,\\to_i\">\\(\\Sigma_i,R_i,V,T_i,\\to_i\\)</span> 及并系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,R,T,\\to\">\\(\\Sigma,R,T,\\to\\)</span>；两个函数符号集不交，原分量和混合项的关系分别在各自签名中计算。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WN}\">\\(\\mathrm{WN}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"049c0e933557b214\" href=\"?note=049c0e933557b214\" title=\"56-df-weakly-normalizing\">56-df-weakly-normalizing</a>，层数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"01802560a40eec95\" href=\"?note=01802560a40eec95\" title=\"56-df-modular-term-rank\">56-df-modular-term-rank</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WN}(T,\\to)\\Longleftrightarrow\\bigl(\\mathrm{WN}(T_0,\\to_0)\\land\\mathrm{WN}(T_1,\\to_1)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{WN}(T,\\to)\\Longleftrightarrow\\bigl(\\mathrm{WN}(T_0,\\to_0)\\land\\mathrm{WN}(T_1,\\to_1)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>已核对原书陈述和 p167 的证明。正向把混合系统的归约限制到纯色项即可，纯色项不会引入另一签名的符号。逆向按层数归纳：先归一化主要子项，再把黑色正规子项按“相等当且仅当使用同一新变量”抽象，归一化白色骨架，最后代回。相等性保持条件保证非左线性规则不会在代回后意外产生新红项。变量互异不是正确条件，必须保留相等子项的相等性。</p>\n<p>来源为用户提供的 Terese (2003) 本地 DjVu，当前文字层已重新解码并核对一致。OCR 页块序号不等于 DjVu 物理页码；未取得 PDF 页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-disjoint-union","status":"resolved","id":"73130ab4ebcdfb39","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"